    "title": "Opening for Production Engineer at Larsen & Toubro",
    "description": "We at Larsen & Toubro are looking for an experienced Production Engineer based out of Pimpri-Chinchwad. If you are a result-oriented professional with a passion for excellence, we want to hear from you.\n\nAbout Larsen & Toubro:\nLarsen & Toubro is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Implement 5S, Kaizen, and Six Sigma practices on the shop floor\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Manage supplier quality audits and vendor development\n• Implement lean manufacturing and continuous improvement initiatives\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in GD&T\n• Proficiency in Project Management\n• Proficiency in APQP\n• Proficiency in SAP MM/PP\n• Proficiency in Lean Manufacturing\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Flexible working hours\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Pimpri-Chinchwad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Larsen & Toubro!",
